{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"]]},"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultSize","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4SizeV","text":"Size","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"title":"defaultSize(_:)","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE11defaultSizeyQrAA0F0VF","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI"},"abstract":[{"text":"Sets a default size for a window.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultSize","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"size","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4SizeV","text":"Size","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Size"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","text":"Scene"},{"kind":"text","text":"\n"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The default size for new windows created from a scene.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"size"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"return-value","type":"heading","text":"Return Value","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A scene that uses a default size for new windows.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use this scene modifier to indicate a default initial size for a new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"window that the system creates from a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"},{"type":"text","text":" declaration. For"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"example, you can request that new windows that a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"generates occupy 600 points in the x-dimension and 400 points in"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the y-dimension:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            ContentView()","        }","        .defaultSize(CGSize(width: 600, height: 400))","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The size that you specify acts only as a default for when the window","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"first appears. People can later resize the window using interface","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"controls that the system provides. Also, during state restoration,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the system restores windows to their most recent size rather than","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the default size.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you specify a default size that’s outside the range of the window’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"inherent resizability in one or both dimensions, the system clamps the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"affected dimension to keep it in range. You can configure the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"resizability of a scene using the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene\/windowResizability(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"modifier."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The default size modifier affects any scene type that creates windows","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"in macOS, namely:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","type":"reference","isActive":true}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"Window","type":"codeVoice"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"DocumentGroup","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Settings"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you want to specify the input directly in terms of width and height,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Scene\/defaultSize(width:height:)"},{"type":"text","text":" instead."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scene\/defaultsize(_:)"]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene\/defaultSize(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Size":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Size","type":"topic","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/size","title":"Size","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Size"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Size"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Scene":{"kind":"symbol","title":"Scene","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A part of an app’s user interface with a life cycle managed by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system."}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scene","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Scene","kind":"identifier"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Scene","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","type":"topic","role":"symbol"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/WindowGroup":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WindowGroup","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WindowGroup","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/windowgroup","abstract":[{"text":"A scene that presents a group of identically structured windows.","type":"text"}],"title":"WindowGroup"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"kind":"symbol","role":"collection","title":"OpenSwiftUI","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Scene/defaultSize(_:)":{"abstract":[{"text":"Sets a default size for a window.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scene\/defaultsize(_:)","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultSize"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4SizeV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Size"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":"